    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Growing up in the coastal tapestry of Kilifi in coastal Kenya, Kennedy Karima's fascination with the world of radio was ignited by his cousin's work at a local station known as Baraka FM. The allure of the airwaves, the power of storytelling, and the ability to connect with diverse audiences captivated him from a young age. This early exposure laid the foundation for a lifelong passion that would lead him on a journey towards strategic communication.",
